WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.421
SOLID. Show a wooden block keeping its shape in two boxes.

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:07.419
LIQUID. Move water from a wide bowl into a tall cup.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:10.587
GAS. Show air filling a rounded balloon.

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:15.739
COMPARE. Label solid, liquid and gas with their behaviours.
